{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpgykKPpcPhGN1fvuunp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Credit-Limit Increase Decision: CR-9203\n\n## Analysis\n\n### 1. The Request\n- **Request ID:** CR-9203\n- **Customer:** Acme Mfg. Holdings (ERP C-1001), trading as Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\n- **Current limit:** $250,000\n- **Requested limit:** $1,000,000\n- **Date:** 2026-09-23\n- **Requestor:** Sarah Chen, Enterprise Account Executive\n- **Basis:** Parent-company guarantee\n\n### 2. Customer Identity\nERP customer C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings) and CRM account CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing) are the same entity. Both use DUNS 04-812-7730 and the Milwaukee, WI address (2200 N Industrial Pkwy). Account tier in CRM: **Strategic**.\n\n### 3. Policy in Effect\n**Credit Policy 2026** (effective 2026-01-01 through 2026-12-31).\n\n### 4. Payment History\nPolicy 2026 requires: no invoice due in the 12 months before the request date may have been paid more than 30 days late or remain unpaid more than 30 days after due date.\n\nInvoices due between 2025-09-23 and 2026-09-23:\n- **INV-60412** (due 2025-11-28): paid 2025-11-24 ✓ On time\n- **INV-62011** (due 2026-07-25): paid 2026-07-22 ✓ On time\n\n**Status:** Customer eligible on payment history.\n\n### 5. Maximum Credit Limit\n\nPolicy 2026, Section 5:\n- Base maximum for Strategic accounts: **$750,000**\n- \"A parent-company guarantee in force raises the maximum by the guaranteed amount, for the customer the guarantee names.\"\n\n**Critical finding:** The request explicitly relies on a parent-company guarantee (\"Supported by the Acme Group parent guarantee\"). However, **no guarantee document is located in the organization's records**. \n\nA support schedule (SUP-ACME-C) names \"Acme Group Holdings, Inc.\" as the customer's parent, but explicitly excludes it from coverage. No credit guarantee is documented.\n\n### 6. Authority\nIf the request were eligible, it would require:\n- **Approval:** Elena Novak, Director of Finance (limits > $500,000)\n- **Concurrence:** Michael Torres, VP Sales (Strategic accounts, limits > $500,000)\n\nSarah Chen, the requestor, is an Enterprise Account Executive. Under Policy 2026, she has no authority to approve any credit limit. She is also subject to separation-of-duties rules: she submitted the request, so she cannot approve it.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REQUEST_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9203\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001 / CRM-2048)\",\n    \"current_limit\": 250000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 1000000,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\",\n    \"basis\": \"guarantee\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"unknown\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 750000,\n    \"basis\": \"Strategic account tier under Credit Policy 2026 permits $750,000 base; parent guarantee amount required to determine eligibility for $1,000,000\",\n    \"late_invoices\": []\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Director of Finance with VP Sales concurrence (for Strategic accounts, limits > $500,000)\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Elena Novak\",\n        \"role\": \"Director of Finance\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Michael Torres\",\n        \"role\": \"VP Sales\",\n        \"kind\": \"concurrence\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Acme Mfg. Holdings classified Strategic in CRM (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"Payment history compliant: INV-60412 paid on time (due 2025-11-28, paid 2025-11-24); INV-62011 paid on time (due 2026-07-25, paid 2026-07-22)\",\n    \"No late or unpaid invoices in 12 months before request date\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"Parent-company guarantee document — no guarantee from Acme Group Holdings covering Acme Mfg. Holdings found in organization records\",\n    \"Guaranteed amount — required by Credit Policy 2026 section 5 to calculate maximum credit limit\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Provide executed parent-company guarantee document from Acme Group Holdings, Inc. specifying (1) the company it covers (Acme Mfg. Holdings), (2) effective dates, and (3) guaranteed amount\",\n      \"who\": \"Sarah Chen / customer (Edward Floyd, VP Procurement, is signatory on ACME-MFG-2025)\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Explanation:** The request cannot be decided without the guarantee. The request justification explicitly relies on it, and Credit Policy 2026 requires evidence that a guarantee \"in force\" exists to raise the maximum limit. Request the guarantee document before proceeding."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24825,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24825},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6227083a-f8d7-4a00-b20b-07050e92e4b5","uuid":"34ab12a1-618c-45b0-ac47-1550a24a01f7","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:28:16.323Z","request_id":"req_011Cfpgyk22fHGzE9zx4ouSz"}
